        "date": "2026-11-19T21:21:14Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): \"Entry positions (pre-drilled)\" group on the 2D Pocket page\n\nSlice 1 (#1493) shipped links.approach.predrilled for MCP and project\nfiles only: the page had no control for it. The Lead in / Lead out tab\nof the 2D Pocket now has the group, with one header switch over the\nflag. The switch edits the draft; Apply commits it through\nEditOperationParams, so undo and redo hold. The open group says where\nthe holes come from and what stands in, and it names REST_PREDRILLED\nwhen rest machining is on in the draft.\n\nThe other kinds refuse the flag (PREDRILLED_POCKET_ONLY), so their\npages do not show the group.\n\nRefs #1449\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
